&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SALEM, Ore. &mdash;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt; A 26-year-old Salem man is in custody following a series of violent crimes committed Monday morning, including arson, robbery, and assault.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
