&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Interviews available from:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

