&lt;p style="margin-left:5.0pt"&gt;Contact: Cyndi Holloway, 360.601-3298 &lt;a href="mailto:Cyndi.holloway@wasteconnections.com"&gt;Cyndi.holloway@wasteconnections.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

