&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:16px"&gt;Following the keynote address,&amp;nbsp;regional leaders from the trade infrastructure, tourism, and hospitality industries will provide a&amp;nbsp;dynamic panel discussion, moderated by Blair Best of KGW. They will offer their perspectives on the larger economic trends influencing our region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:16px"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
