&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Staff and visitors may experience temporary disruptions in the 820 building. However, these can be minimized by using the 800 building elevator, which connects to 820. Clatsop County will continue to provide reasonable accommodations and communicate alternate access plans as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
