&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;On December 17, around 3:00 p.m., Salem SWAT served a search warrant at the Beechwood Court S residence of Freedom Butler, 24, of Salem. Butler was taken into custody and faces charges of Assault in the First Degree, Attempted Murder in the Second Degree, Unlawful Use of a Weapon, and Felon in Possession of a Firearm. During the operation, several people were detained. One of them, Austin Myers, 37, of Salem, was arrested on unrelated charges of Felon in Possession of a Firearm and Possession of a Controlled Substance &ndash; Methamphetamine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
